{s:BDSousTitre|Caractéristiques}
{s:BDTexte|'''For''' 21, '''Dex''' 14, '''Con''' 18, '''Int''' 10, '''Sag''' 12, '''Cha''' 8}
{s:BDTexte|'''BBA''' +6, '''BMO''' +11, '''DMD''' 22}
